/**
 * @file
 * @brief Doxygen module definitions for Interstellar.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup interstellar_sdk Interstellar SDK
 * @brief Top-level documentation group for all Interstellar modules.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup logging_api Logging API
 * @ingroup interstellar_sdk
 * @brief Public, category-based logging facilities for the Interstellar codebase.
 *
 * Thin facade over spdlog that provides named loggers, consistent patterns,
 * and predictable flush behavior.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup io_api IO API
 * @ingroup interstellar_sdk
 * @brief Filesystem abstraction and data serialization helpers.
 *
 * The IO module provides:
 * - `IFilesystem`: an abstract interface for file operations
 * - `LocalFilesystem`: production implementation using the OS filesystem
 * - `MemoryFilesystem`: in-memory mock useful for tests/tools
 * - `FileIO`: high-level wrapper for safe load/save with serializers
 * - `ISerializer<T>`: pluggable serializer interface for arbitrary data types
 * - Container packing/unpacking with CRC32 validation
 *
 * Together these components allow game systems to read and write structured
 * data in a format- and filesystem-agnostic way, with safety against
 * corruption and version mismatches.
 */
